{"id":"ambition","lemma":"ambition","pos":"noun","rank":3648,"glosses":["ambition"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.bi.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/Fr-ambition.ogg/Fr-ambition.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ambitions"},"formAudio":{"ambitions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-ambitions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Son ambition est de devenir avocat.","en":"His ambition is to be a lawyer.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"lawyer, attorney"}]},{"text":"J'ai de l'ambition.","en":"I have ambition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095681","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"N'as-tu donc aucune ambition ?","en":"Don't you have any ambition?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"therefore"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Son ambition ne connaît pas de limites.","en":"His ambition knows no bounds.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"edgy","l":"limite"}]},{"text":"Mon professeur m'a encouragé à réaliser mes ambitions.","en":"My teacher encouraged me to fulfill my ambitions.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"teacher"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to encourage","l":"encourager"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to direct"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}